  "title": "Himalaya Shipping Ltd. (HSHP) – Conversions to fixed rate time charters for four vessels for the month of June",
  "summary": "Hamilton, Bermuda, May 29, 2026 The Company has agreed to convert the index-linked time charters for four vessels to fixed rate time charters at an average rate of approximately US$56,500 per day, gross, for the month of June 2026. In addition, the above vessels will continue to earn scrubber benefits according to the terms of […]",
